# Line endings are pinned for generated data files.
#
# Why: scripts/build_en_kb.py regenerates data/wellness_kb.en.csv, and
# validate.yml fails the build if the committed file differs from a fresh
# rebuild ("generated files differ from a fresh rebuild"). On a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true the working tree was CRLF while the index
# was LF, so the comparison silently passed on the author's machine and failed
# on every Linux runner — a red CI badge that looked like a content bug but
# was purely line endings.
#
# Pinning these to LF makes checkout bytes and generated bytes identical on
# every platform.
*.csv text eol=lf
